  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Paolo Orlandi is an Italian entrepreneur who built his fortune through Orlandi Valuta, a California money-transfer business serving the US–Mexico market. Born in Subiaco and raised in Tivoli, he worked in a Rome bank's foreign-exchange department before emigrating to America. He sold the company to Western Union and retired from it.",
    "html": "<p>Paolo Orlandi is an Italian entrepreneur who built his fortune through Orlandi Valuta, a California money-transfer business serving the US–Mexico market. Born in Subiaco and raised in Tivoli, he worked in a Rome bank's foreign-exchange department before emigrating to America. He sold the company to Western Union and retired from it.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 52,
    "confidence": {
      "score": 85,
      "band": "high",
      "reason": "Published interview, attributed archival extract and contemporaneous company-marketing statement support the selected facts."
    },
